[en.IDEA_C03_C04_TRADE]
Cloudsdale-Stratusburg Trade Agreement

[en.IDEA_C03_C04_TRADE_desc]
In this way, Cloudsdale does not need to pay any fees, and Stratusburg can obtain the old site of the Wonderbolts Academy.

[zh.IDEA_C03_C04_TRADE]
云中城-层云堡贸易协定

[zh.IDEA_C03_C04_TRADE_desc]
云中城将闪电天马学院原址划归到层云堡管理，以此交换层云堡一年的马芬产量。如此，云中城不需要支付任何费用，而层云堡也可以获得闪电天马学院旧址。
